  {"comment": "SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT. Lofted Flange (mitcad#2512): transitions made as sheet between two profiles. Rules F1: t 2, K 0 first (the blank is the profile surface: the facets' exact areas), then K 0.5 (the blank is the middle surface, and the folded body's volume is t times its area: the area of a developable surface moved h along its normals grows linearly with h, folds meeting on their mitres). The expected values are worked out apart from the model (the front and middle surfaces' facets and cones, integrated)."},
